\[
v_{g}=\nabla_{q} \omega=\frac{\partial \omega}{\partial q_{1}} \boldsymbol{i}+\frac{\partial \omega}{\partial q_{2}} \boldsymbol{j}
\]

where \(\boldsymbol{i}\) and \(\boldsymbol{j}\) are unit vectors in the \(x\) and \(y\) directions, respectively. Substituting into the dispersion relation, we obtain

\[
